Planetary orbit      ~ 1 yr
Solar cycle          ~ 11 yr
Galactic crossing    ~ 32 Myr
Galactic orbit       ~ 230 Myr
Solar age            ~ 4.6 Gyr

The huge spacing between these scales supports hierarchical and perturbative descriptions.

